                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This might genuinely be one of the worst games I've ever played, the controls are abysmal and the gameplay is even worse, like wow it's so fun to constantly just be running away from things you can't even see because the screen keeps zooming in on you while every rapidly moving enemy or attack is offscreen which also oneshots you unless you're playing on baby mode (that one is so boringly easy that you might as well be spectating the game in god mode)\n\nAlso the game genuinely breaks based on your fps and either makes the game unplayable or too easy because at too high fps when you attack time accelerates instead of slowing down so you can't even play the game and if your fps are too low then it slows down so much that you genuinely can't lose\n\nReplaying this for completion wasn't as bad as before but it still isn't a game I would ever recommend to someone",
